      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The necrolyte is a 5th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 13, +5 to hit with spell attacks). The necrolyte regains its expended spell slots when it finishes a short or long rest, and knows the following priest and warlock spells: Cantrips (at will): <em>chill touch, ✦ diabolism, ✦ mind blast, resistance, sapping sting, toll the dead</em> 1st-3rd level (2 3rd-level slots): <em>blindness/deafness, ✦ dark void, ✦ drain life, fear, ray of enfeeblement, speak with dead</em></p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
